        &= \left. \frac{d}{d\lambda} \right|_{\lambda=1} \Re(\mathscr{D}_c u, u(\lambda x))_{L^2} \\
        &= \left. \frac{d}{d\lambda} \right|_{\lambda=1} \lambda^{-3} \Re \left( \widehat{\mathscr{D}_c}(\xi) \hat{u}(\xi), \hat{u}(\lambda^{-1} \xi) \right)_{L^2} \\
